	(text "ADC_SCK: 9.375 MHz or less at 100 kSPS (16 or more system clock\ncycles per bit), 15 MHz at most for the 500 kSPS option (10 per bit).\nRegister at 3.3 V (datasheet): load pulse 9 ns or longer,\nclock to Q7 18 ns at most.\nTime in which both data lines can be read (calculated):\n36.9 ns at 9.375 MHz, 16.9 ns at 15 MHz; the controller needs\ntwo system clock cycles, 13.3 ns.\nR138 is the series resistor at the driver of SIDE_DOUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2f231e63-2f73-5170-bd24-cbfc14ab25df")
	)
	(text "U33, U34: SN74LV165A only. Its inputs take 5.5 V whatever\nthe supply (datasheet); a 74HC or 74HCT type does not, and the\ncontroller module can drive these lines while the carrier is off.\nVIN_OV and PWR_GOOD are taken on the carrier side of the series\nresistors of the controller pins (4.7 k and 1 k). PWR_GOOD reaches\nD0 at 0.79 x +3V3_C or more (calculated); the input needs 0.70 x.\nRN6, RN7: the translator outputs are off while its DUT-side\nsupply is below 0.1 V; the eight logic bits then read 0.\nDS of U33 is high: ones follow the sixteen bits and are never read."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa500583-0566-597c-b986-72cdb8f1c3d4")
	)
	(text "How a sample gets its sixteen side bits:\n1. SIDE_LOAD is low at the convert-start edge of the converter, for three system clock\n   cycles (20 ns) or more. U33 and U34 follow their inputs while it is low and hold\n   them when it rises; SIDE_DOUT then shows MUX_A1.\n2. Each rising edge of ADC_SCK brings the next bit. The order on SIDE_DOUT:\n   MUX_A1, MUX_A0 (range), GATE_OUT, VIN_OV, CMP_OC, CMP_JUMP, CMP_UP, PWR_GOOD,\n   then the logic inputs DIN7 down to DIN0.\n3. The controller reads SIDE_DOUT and the data pin of the converter at the same instants:\n   every sample carries the range, the flags and the logic levels of its own instant.\nController in reset or absent: pull-downs on the Controller sheet hold SIDE_LOAD and\nADC_SCK low; the registers follow their inputs and nothing is shifted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "baab8289-208a-5661-af18-53b243deb290")
	)
